  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本资源包改变了 Minecraft 中许多原版生物的外观！目前，它改变了以下生物的外观（未来还会添加更多材质）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 僵尸</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 骷髅</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 苦力怕</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 蜘蛛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 僵尸猪灵</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 洞穴蜘蛛</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 尸壳</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 疣猪兽</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 烈焰人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>（也可与 OptiFine 配合使用）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">材质和模型的设计者为 AviArt。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一个与朋友一起游玩的服务器吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_promo2.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"251\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在寻找一个可以与朋友一起游玩任何模组或整合包的服务器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 就是你的解决方案！他们提供最佳性价比的 Minecraft 服务器，如果点击 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此链接</a></strong></span>，并使用代码 \"Lupin\"，你将获得 25% 的折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"149\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">本资源包改变了社区中最受欢迎的一些原版生物的外观，现在它们将看起来更逼真、更有趣！但别担心，它们仍会保持原版友好风格，同时与默认纹理有一定的相似性。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"148\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在服务器上有效吗？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">当然！它完美运行！请记住，与模组和朋友们一起游玩的最佳方式是通过 BisectHosting，并且<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此链接可获得 25% 的折扣</a></strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>这个资源包可以在整合包中使用吗？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">当然可以！但仅限于在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上发布。上传到其他任何平台都将侵犯我们的权利，这是完全不允许的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不过，如果你考虑将其添加到你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我们将不胜感激。如果你需要任何小的改动或有任何疑问，请联系我们！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Mobs/BH_Realistic_Mobs_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"149\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/606/realistic-mobs.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1020/636/realistic-mobs-55.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/435/realistic-mobs.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1071/437/realistic-mobs-3.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
